  lore: {
    about: "A watcher from beyond the Stridergate, born of Aleph-1's design. Before those who seek answers, Aleph-1 projects the very boundary of the knowable: that which once opened the way to the future has now become something dark and dreadful beyond recognition. At the scale of the cosmos, life and hope are only trivialities, devoid of meaning. Everything is but a beginning without an end. Everything is but a pursuit in vain.",
